    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128478006\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Power of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128478007\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/god-power-of?lang=eng\">God, Power of</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-authority-of?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Authority of</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478008\" id=\"p1\">I am the <span class=\"key-word\">Almighty</span> God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Gen. 17:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478009\" id=\"p2\">his name shall be called … The <span class=\"key-word\">mighty</span> God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Isa. 9:6</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">2 Ne. 19:6</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478010\" id=\"p3\">he gave them <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> against unclean spirits, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Matt. 10:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478011\" id=\"p4\">coming … with <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> and great glory, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p30#p30\">Matt. 24:30</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/js-m/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">JS—M 1:36</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478012\" id=\"p5\">All <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> is given unto me in heaven and in earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/28?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Matt. 28:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478013\" id=\"p6\">Son of man hath <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> … to forgive sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Mark 2:10</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Luke 5:24</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478014\" id=\"p7\">All things were <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> by him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">John 1:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478015\" id=\"p8\">gave he <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> to become the sons of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">John 1:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478016\" id=\"p9\">given him <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> over all flesh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">John 17:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478017\" id=\"p10\">God hath made that same Jesus … both <span class=\"key-word\">Lord</span> and Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">Acts 2:36</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478018\" id=\"p11\">declared to be the Son of God with <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Rom. 1:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478019\" id=\"p12\">gospel of Christ … the <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> of God unto salvation, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Rom. 1:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478020\" id=\"p13\">his eternal <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> and Godhead, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Rom. 1:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478021\" id=\"p14\">he shall have put down all … authority and <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">1 Cor. 15:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478022\" id=\"p15\">put <span class=\"key-word\">all</span> things under his feet, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Eph. 1:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478023\" id=\"p16\">Strengthened … according to his glorious <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Col. 1:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478024\" id=\"p17\"><span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, be unto him that sitteth upon the throne, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Rev. 5:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478025\" id=\"p18\"><span class=\"key-word\">Lord</span> of lords, and King of kings, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Rev. 17:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478026\" id=\"p19\">Lord God <span class=\"key-word\">omnipotent</span> reigneth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Rev. 19:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478027\" id=\"p20\">saith the Lord God <span class=\"key-word\">Almighty</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/28?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">2 Ne. 28:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478028\" id=\"p21\">with power, the Lord <span class=\"key-word\">Omnipotent</span> … shall come down, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Mosiah 3:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478029\" id=\"p22\">Retaining all <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, even to the destroying of Satan, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">D&amp;C 19:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478030\" id=\"p23\">for all things are <span class=\"key-word\">subject</span> unto him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/50?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">D&amp;C 50:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478031\" id=\"p24\">by my <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> will I make known … secrets, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">D&amp;C 76:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478032\" id=\"p25\">by him … worlds are and were <span class=\"key-word\">created</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">D&amp;C 76:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478033\" id=\"p26\">in the ordinances thereof, the <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> of godliness is manifest, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/84?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">D&amp;C 84:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478034\" id=\"p27\">Christ … light of the sun, and the <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> thereof by which it was made, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/88?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">D&amp;C 88:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478035\" id=\"p28\"><span class=\"key-word\">power</span> of God who sitteth upon his throne, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/88?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">D&amp;C 88:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478036\" id=\"p29\">he received all <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, both in heaven and on earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">D&amp;C 93:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478037\" id=\"p30\">I am the Lord God <span class=\"key-word\">Almighty</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Moses 1:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478038\" id=\"p31\">by the word of my <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, have I created them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">Moses 1:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478039\" id=\"p32\">hath all <span class=\"key-word\">power</span> according to wisdom, mercy, truth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p61#p61\">Moses 6:61</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478040\" id=\"p33\">God shall take in his heart to do … he will <span class=\"key-word\">do</span> it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Abr. 3:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128478041\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p35#p35\">John 3:35</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">13:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Rom. 14:9</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">1 Cor. 8:6</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Eph. 1:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
